@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 124
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
title S05-structured-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: AuthController" as ctl
participant "svc: AuditService" as svc
participant "repo: Store" as repo
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. write(actor, key, input)
activate ctl
note right of ctl
PermissionInterceptor has already resolved actor from the user token.
end note
ctl -> svc: 2. external(actor, input, key)
activate svc
svc -> svc: 3. trusted(key)
activate svc
deactivate svc
note right of svc
Check whether the actor has the API permission audit:write.
end note
note right of svc
Validate payload fields and hash canonical JSON.
The digest binds the source system and authenticated actor to the content.
end note
group First audit transaction (REQUIRES_NEW)
svc -> repo: 4. one(AuditLog.class, requestId predicate)
activate repo
repo -->> svc: existing audit or null
deactivate repo
alt Known ID
svc -> svc: 5. same(existing, payload)
activate svc
break Conflict
svc -->> obj: 400 AUDIT_DUPLICATE_CONFLICT
||16||
end
deactivate svc
note right of svc
Keep the original audit record and ID.
end note
else New requestId
note right of svc
Build the AuditLog and truncate occurredAt to milliseconds.
end note
svc -> repo: 6. save(log)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> repo: 7. flush()
activate repo
deactivate repo
||16||
end
end
opt Retry
note right of svc
Catch DataIntegrityViolationException after the first transaction rolls back.
Concurrent insertion of the same requestId is one cause.
end note
group Read again (separate REQUIRES_NEW transaction)
svc -> repo: 8. one(AuditLog.class, requestId predicate)
activate repo
repo -->> svc: existing audit or null
deactivate repo
alt Record found
svc -> svc: 9. same(existing, payload)
activate svc
break Conflict
svc -->> obj: 400 AUDIT_DUPLICATE_CONFLICT
||16||
end
deactivate svc
note right of svc
Keep the original audit record and ID.
end note
else Record absent
break Missing
svc -->> obj: Rethrow the original database exception
||16||
end
end
end
end
note over svc,ctl
Complete the audit transaction before replying.
After a timeout, retry with the original requestId.
end note
svc -->> ctl: audit record
deactivate svc
ctl -->> obj: 201 audit result
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml